0..58 Comment "/// This source states rotation group laws for the circle."
59..62 Comment "///"
63..123 Comment "/// Rotation has four inverse laws and a universal property."
124..153 Comment "/// It follows cubical Agda\'s"
154..211 Comment "/// `Cubical/HITs/S1/Base.agda` and `S1/Properties.agda`."
212..215 Comment "///"
216..294 Comment "/// The checker computes rotation by the loop and checks each path over words."
295..298 Comment "///"
299..374 Comment "/// Limits: `rotIsEquiv` needs equivalences as structure. `invS¹Equiv` and"
375..416 Comment "/// `invS¹Path` need univalence as well."
417..420 Comment "///"
421..472 Comment "/// - see: corpus/model/identity/circle-group.gandr"
